OL,3,GNEWSAFire at university site
OL,4,A'deliberate', fire service says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire at a former Liverpool university
OL,7,Fcampus was started deliberately,
OL,8,Finvestigators have found.
OL,10,FFire crews were called to a fire in the
OL,11,Froof of the unoccupied Liverpool John
OL,12,FMoores University (LJMU) IM Marsh site
OL,13,Fon Barkhill Road shortly after 15:40
OL,14,FBST on Saturday.
OL,16,FA joint investigation by Merseyside
OL,17,FFire and Rescue Service and Merseyside
OL,18,FPolice concluded the cause was
OL,19,F"deliberate ignition".
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
